      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "functional requirements(business related logic)\n1. user can search for restaurants based on location\n2. user can add items to cart\n3. users can checkout by making payments\n4. user shoudl be notified once order is placed successfully\n\n\nNon-functional requiremnts(extra requirements, like scalability, microservices etc) \n1. each post of design shoudl be scalabe and modifiable  \n\n\n\nquestions to ask(can be n numebr of question to be asked by u)\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "functional requirements(business related logic)\n1. user can search for restaurants based on location\n2. user can add items to cart\n3. users can checkout by making payments\n4. user shoudl be notified once order is placed successfully\n\n\nNon-functional requiremnts(extra requirements, like scalability, microservices etc) \n1. each post of design shoudl be scalabe and modifiable  \n\n\n\nquestions to ask(can be n numebr of question to be asked by u)\n\n\n",
